  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "champ_0220_stopper_01",
      "hash64": "A70D68ECF0A6BE31",
      "text": "回不去了！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "champ_0220_stopper_02",
      "hash64": "A70D65ECF0A6B918",
      "text": "不打赢对战就无法前进！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "champ_0220_system_01",
      "hash64": "73B89DD4C5087C33",
      "text": "[EMPTY 18]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "BDFF",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "champ_0220_ground_01",
      "hash64": "D97FE04188CF308D",
      "text": "好，那我们就赶紧开始吧。[VAR 0x0114(0013)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 12,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0013"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "champ_0220_ground_02",
      "hash64": "D97FDD4188CF2B74",
      "text": "给四天王打头阵的\\n就是我辛俐！[VAR 0x0114(0013)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0013"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "champ_0220_ground_03",
      "hash64": "D97FDE4188CF2D27",
      "text": "我会好好疼爱你的，\\n你就……卯足了劲加油吧～！[VAR 0x0114(0013)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0013"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "champ_0220_ground_04",
      "hash64": "D97FDB4188CF280E",
      "text": "啊～太强了，太强了，\\n这怎么赢得了呢。[VAR 0x0114(0013)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0013"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "champ_0220_ground_05",
      "hash64": "D97FDC4188CF29C1",
      "text": "这场对战我虽然输了，\\n但心里可是畅快得不得了哦。[VAR 0x0114(0013)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0013"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "champ_0220_ground_06",
      "hash64": "D97FD94188CF24A8",
      "text": "能通过技能测验的训练家\\n就像凤毛麟角一样少。[VAR 0x0114(0013)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0013"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "champ_0220_ground_07",
      "hash64": "D97FDA4188CF265B",
      "text": "不过，[VAR 0x0100(0000)]，\\n如果是你的话，说不定能搞出些名堂来哦。[VAR 0x0114(0013)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 3,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 28,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0013"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "champ_0220_ground_08",
      "hash64": "D97FD74188CF2142",
      "text": "第二个四天王更厉害，\\n你可要卯足了劲加油呀。[VAR 0x0114(0013)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0013"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "champ_0220_ground_09",
      "hash64": "D97FD84188CF22F5",
      "text": "喂～下一个，该出场啦～[VAR 0x0114(0013)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 11,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0013"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "champ_0220_steel_01",
      "hash64": "9293552F48E4D169",
      "text": "好～[VAR 0x0114(0014)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 2,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0014"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "champ_0220_steel_02",
      "hash64": "9293522F48E4CC50",
      "text": "辛俐姐，你输啦～！？[VAR 0x0114(0014)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 10,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0014"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "champ_0220_ground_10",
      "hash64": "D983454188D21203",
      "text": "是呀～\\n对手贼厉害哦。[VAR 0x0114(0013)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 11,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0013"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "champ_0220_ground_11",
      "hash64": "D983444188D21050",
      "text": "我会在旁边观战的，\\n你可要替你辛俐姐找回场子啊。[VAR 0x0114(0013)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0013"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "champ_0220_steel_03",
      "hash64": "9293532F48E4CE03",
      "text": "我知道啦！[VAR 0x0114(0014)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 5,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0014"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "champ_0220_ground_12",
      "hash64": "D983474188D21569",
      "text": "我要亲眼见证一下\\n你到底能走到哪一步。[VAR 0x0114(0013)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0013"
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
